WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.508
She almost didn't post it.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:11.519
One uneven bowl. One shaky video. One small
beginning.

3
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:22.581
But somewhere nearby, someone was sharing how
they started, too. The mistakes. The practice.
The day it finally worked.

4
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:32.077
On iAdMe, discover local videos and stories of
people moving forward. Find a creator. Start a
conversation.

5
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:37.955
Turn that spark into a Target, and take your
own next step.

6
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:48.745
Success doesn't always begin with a crowd.
Sometimes, it begins with someone saying, keep
going.

7
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.614
Your city is full of stories worth finding.
And yours is worth sharing.

8
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.605
iAdMe. Find your people. Share your story.
